the deeper architecture, and I think your instinct is pointing toward something better than a simple “fork the Superbrain” model.

There are really two separate systems here:

NayaPOWER as your application/intelligence platform — which we can run directly on Cloudflare and connect to GitHub.
The Naya Collective — where independent people/agents can voluntarily contribute knowledge extracted from their own Superbrain without surrendering their private Superbrain.

